        "text": {
          "Text": "Layer Blend lays a Foreground over a Background by a Blend Mode. In Difference, black leaves the background alone and white turns it inside out, so the stripes invert inside the white hexagon. Try Multiply, Screen, Overlay and Exclusion, and lower Opacity."
